#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
Ubuntu workstation helpers

Common commands:
  ws-new <template> <project-name> [options]
      Create a project-scoped Distrobox.

  ws-enter <project-name>
      Enter the project Distrobox and start in the project folder.

  ws-list
      List project environments.

  ws-remove <project-name>
      Remove a project Distrobox after confirmation.

  ws-code <project-name> [code-args...]
      Launch VS Code from the project Distrobox.

  ws-code --base [code-args...]
      Launch VS Code from the SDK-free dev-base box.

  ws-ai-setup
      Repair or update the shared ai-code box with Claude Code and Codex CLI.

  ws-claude <project-name> [claude-args...]
      Run Claude Code from ai-code in the selected project folder.

  ws-codex <project-name> [codex-args...]
      Run Codex CLI from ai-code in the selected project folder.

  ws-ai-shell <project-name>
      Enter ai-code in the selected project folder.

Templates:
  rust rust-nightly cpp csharp dotnet java js node python php generic

Examples:
  ws-new rust Terrakit
  ws-new dotnet HackJack --with-devcontainer
  ws-new node CSIT314-TalentMatching
  ws-new cpp EngineExperiment
  ws-new rust-nightly CompilerExperiment
  ws-enter Terrakit
  ws-code Terrakit
  ws-code --base
  ws-ai-setup
  ws-claude Terrakit
  ws-codex Terrakit
  ws-list
  ws-remove Terrakit

Project layout:
  Source:    ~/Projects/<project-name>
  Box home:  ~/Boxes/projects/<project-name>
  Box name:  project-<normalized-project-name>
EOF
